{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（2日）上午11時25分，屯門龍富路迴旋處近屯門赤鱲角隧道公路，一輛貨櫃車懷疑「自炒」剷上路中石壆，撞塌路牌，男司機暈倒車內。救援人員到場將司機救出，隨即將他送往屯門醫院搶救，警方正調查事故成因。</p><p>現場消息指，事主58歲，駕駛貨櫃車期間「自炒」剷上路中分隔石壆，並陷入昏迷。消防員到場打破乘客車窗將他救出，然後送院。</p><figure><img alt=\"貨櫃車剷上路壆撞塌一個交通指示牌。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261002/1182660646777393152819507.jpeg/41QyrOzigsPPWNeJmWp5307Km_A95B97SpqPdG-aj3Q\"/><figcaption>貨櫃車剷上路壆撞塌一個交通指示牌。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨櫃車剷上路中分隔石壆。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261002/1182659529549025280124980.jpeg/1HUuP8x895JR1w6os8gMkU80n45mC-kHkkk1NbdJNTU\"/><figcaption>貨櫃車剷上路中分隔石壆。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場遺下一隻相信屬於事主的鞋。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261002/1182660912935342080792036.jpeg/90kvZV3BGEew29-GhjJ7ZAKu0Mlgr-QHY7UbF0a1Gxc\"/><figcaption>現場遺下一隻相信屬於事主的鞋。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261002/1182659163616972800428679.jpeg/YbIvJ6YQx7dsmUVsak3bePvJqWzDADJ4Z9VPWkLVT1o\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261002/1182659388599439360173568.jpeg/epBHMFLjT2bp7Sbxrhd_AzRBpygJ_psj5QbckcAG3JE\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在貨櫃車內調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261002/1182659169556369408627954.jpeg/RGpLpB61AKoyJRgD7i_wCROciiNMCpRkIejnSwTo50s\"/><figcaption>警員在貨櫃車內調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T04:19:53.186732+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}